      "description": "Watch Rotherham United vs West Bromwich Albion highlights and goals from Carabao on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 9, 2026. Carabao Cup action at the stadium Rotherham United and West Bromwich Albion met on August 9, 2026, for a high-stakes encounter in the Carabao Cup , with both sides eager to establish early momentum. A clinical first half West Bromwich Albion hit their stride early, with Jimmy-Jay Morgan opening the scoring in the 8th minute following a setup from Harry Whitwell . The visitors doubled their lead in the 24th minute when Harry Whitwell finished from close range. Despite the deficit, Rotherham United looked dangerous on the break, particularly through Paul Mullin , but found themselves thwarted by the opposing goalkeeper throughout the first period. Securing the result After the interval, the game opened up further. Felix Myhre struck in the 55th minute to make it 3-0, and Jimmy-Jay Morgan added his second of the night just six minutes later, assisted by Callum Styles . Rotherham United fought back towards the final whistle, with Fábio Tavares finding the back of the net in the 87th minute to give the home fans a moment of relief. However, the match concluded with a commanding 4-1 victory for West Bromwich Albion ."
